      "value": "That sounds more like an Oculus thing then VRCs responsibility. So unless Oculus makes trackers I don't believe it will happen. Vive trackers need to be tracked by sensors hence the need of PC. Any method without something connected to a PC I am unaware of.",
      "viewerReactions": null
