      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "You’re sadly asking for the impossible. With the quest it simply just wouldn’t happen. The headset having to track hip and feet trackers can’t be done due to the fact the it wouldn’t have sight of them. The use of full body probably won’t every happen with a stand alone system like the quest.",
      "viewerReactions": null
