      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "How do you even imagine this working? The only full body tracking tech that exists is all PC equipment relying on SteamVR. This will only be possible if Oculus releases their own compatible trackers for Quest specifically. Even then, the added processing requirements for such a system may be out of the current Quest's capabilities. It's nice to dream, and Oculus has shown off some ambitions of FBT for the further future, but there's nothing at all VR-Chat can do on this front for now.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
