  "created": "2020-01-28T15:44:00.506Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I have yet to see any regular quest users use full body without being on PC using the link. I want to be able to actually dance without having to use emotes. Hopefully, this will be possible in the near future in 2020",
